#. module: project_task_attachments
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:__manifest__.py
msgid "Helps to view all documents attached to Projects/Tasks"
msgstr "Permite consultar todos los documentos adjuntos a proyectos y tareas"

#. module: project_task_attachments
